# about:logins with a master password set and not entered (cavekit-site-data.md R2, T-664). A locked key store gives no
# login (its username is encrypted too), so the page asks for the master password before it lists anything; a wrong
# one shows nothing, the right one lists the logins and Show reveals the password. The master password is set and taken
# off by the logins component's trace-mode test hook (jihad.test.masterPassword): this browser has no page that sets
# one. The key store is set aside for the run (key-store-clean), so the profile's own is never touched.
id: site-logins-master
section: Privacy and site data
item: With a master password set, about:logins asks for it before listing anything; a wrong one shows nothing, the right one lists the logins and Show reveals the password
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true signon.rememberSignons=true signon.autofillForms=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
kit: cavekit-site-data.md R2
fixture: site-data-clean key-store-clean
wait rect user 30
probe lock '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-lock","lock-pass-3")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait line 'logins: remembered for http://192.168.1.245:8077' 6
wait text sent "sent jihad-lock" 15
setpref s jihad.test.masterPassword set:jihad-master-1
wait line 'test: master password set, the store locked: true' 6
launch about:logins
wait text page-sub "Locked by the master password" 10
expect text-lacks content "jihad-lock"
tap 'sel:.unlock-pass'
type wrong-one-2
tap 'sel:.unlock-btn'
wait text status "not the master password" 4
expect text-lacks content "jihad-lock"
tap 'sel:.unlock-pass'
type jihad-master-1
tap 'sel:.unlock-btn'
wait text logins "jihad-lock" 6
tap 'sel:.login-row[data-user="jihad-lock"] .login-show'
wait text logins "lock-pass-3" 4
setpref s jihad.test.masterPassword clear:jihad-master-1
wait line 'test: master password taken off: true' 6
launch about:logins
wait text logins "jihad-lock" 10
tap 'sel:#remove-all'
tap 'sel:#remove-all'
wait text logins "No logins are saved" 6
